WEBVTT

00:00:00.000 --> 00:00:08.000
Both archers move and aim across the arena.

00:00:08.000 --> 00:00:13.000
Player 2 is hit; Player 1 is hit in return.

00:00:13.000 --> 00:00:21.000
The players reposition and exchange more shots.

00:00:21.000 --> 00:00:30.000
Player 1 loses another point of health.

00:00:30.000 --> 00:00:34.000
Player 2 wins the round.
